[[:db/add "15b93aa7-c591-5841-aa3a-357d8bf16eef" :answer/id #uuid "15b93aa7-c591-5841-aa3a-357d8bf16eef"] [:db/add "15b93aa7-c591-5841-aa3a-357d8bf16eef" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "15b93aa7-c591-5841-aa3a-357d8bf16eef" :answer/value "III only"] [:db/ensure "15b93aa7-c591-5841-aa3a-357d8bf16eef" :answer/validate] [:db/add "70a7bdca-b802-5569-bfd3-d23438559962" :answer/id #uuid "70a7bdca-b802-5569-bfd3-d23438559962"] [:db/add "70a7bdca-b802-5569-bfd3-d23438559962" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "70a7bdca-b802-5569-bfd3-d23438559962" :answer/value "I only"] [:db/ensure "70a7bdca-b802-5569-bfd3-d23438559962" :answer/validate] [:db/add "45cde434-4d75-5c09-9b0f-35b920274076" :answer/id #uuid "45cde434-4d75-5c09-9b0f-35b920274076"] [:db/add "45cde434-4d75-5c09-9b0f-35b920274076" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "45cde434-4d75-5c09-9b0f-35b920274076" :answer/value "II and III only"] [:db/ensure "45cde434-4d75-5c09-9b0f-35b920274076" :answer/validate] [:db/add "52405711-96a4-58b9-b20b-772647cc4c5b" :answer/id #uuid "52405711-96a4-58b9-b20b-772647cc4c5b"] [:db/add "52405711-96a4-58b9-b20b-772647cc4c5b" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "52405711-96a4-58b9-b20b-772647cc4c5b" :answer/value "I and III only"] [:db/ensure "52405711-96a4-58b9-b20b-772647cc4c5b" :answer/validate] [:db/add "cddf6d9c-c0bf-57b1-b126-0839ec3bed59" :answer/id #uuid "cddf6d9c-c0bf-57b1-b126-0839ec3bed59"] [:db/add "cddf6d9c-c0bf-57b1-b126-0839ec3bed59" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "cddf6d9c-c0bf-57b1-b126-0839ec3bed59" :answer/value "II only"] [:db/ensure "cddf6d9c-c0bf-57b1-b126-0839ec3bed59" :answer/validate] [:db/add "e61f64c2-6321-5d18-9115-5e8492b4d1ce" :answer-field/id #uuid "e61f64c2-6321-5d18-9115-5e8492b4d1ce"] [:db/add "e61f64c2-6321-5d18-9115-5e8492b4d1ce" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "e61f64c2-6321-5d18-9115-5e8492b4d1ce" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "e61f64c2-6321-5d18-9115-5e8492b4d1ce" :answer-field/choices "15b93aa7-c591-5841-aa3a-357d8bf16eef"] [:db/add "e61f64c2-6321-5d18-9115-5e8492b4d1ce" :answer-field/choices "70a7bdca-b802-5569-bfd3-d23438559962"] [:db/add "e61f64c2-6321-5d18-9115-5e8492b4d1ce" :answer-field/choices "45cde434-4d75-5c09-9b0f-35b920274076"] [:db/add "e61f64c2-6321-5d18-9115-5e8492b4d1ce" :answer-field/choices "52405711-96a4-58b9-b20b-772647cc4c5b"] [:db/add "e61f64c2-6321-5d18-9115-5e8492b4d1ce" :answer-field/choices "cddf6d9c-c0bf-57b1-b126-0839ec3bed59"] [:db/add "e61f64c2-6321-5d18-9115-5e8492b4d1ce" :answer-field/correct "15b93aa7-c591-5841-aa3a-357d8bf16eef"] [:db/ensure "e61f64c2-6321-5d18-9115-5e8492b4d1ce" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "24f7a599-64fa-59b0-bc94-5119ac1b11b5" :question/id #uuid "24f7a599-64fa-59b0-bc94-5119ac1b11b5"] [:db/add "24f7a599-64fa-59b0-bc94-5119ac1b11b5" :question/problem "Consider the following sentence:\n\n*If $A$ is a $n\\times n$ matrix and $\\operatorname{Null}(A)=\\{0\\}$, then $\\underline{\\phantom{xxxxxx}}$.*\n\nWhich of the following can be placed into the blank space to make a true statement?\n\nI. $\\operatorname{Null}(A)$ has no basis\n\nII. $\\operatorname{Col}(A)\\subsetneq\\mathbb{R}^{n}$\n\nIII. $\\operatorname{nullity}(A)=0$"] [:db/add "24f7a599-64fa-59b0-bc94-5119ac1b11b5" :question/worked-solution "The invertible matrix theorem states the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{gathered}A\\text{ is invertible}\\\\\\Updownarrow\\\\\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{Col}(A)&=\\mathbb{R}^{n}\\\\\\dim(\\operatorname{Col}(A))&=n=\\operatorname{rank}(A)\\\\\\operatorname{Null}(A)&=\\{0\\}\\\\\\dim(\\operatorname{Null}(A))&=0=\\operatorname{nullity}(A)\\end{aligned}\\end{gathered}\n$$\n\nWith that in mind, let's examine each of the options separately.\n\n- The following statement is false:\n\n*If $A$ is a $n\\times n$ matrix and $\\operatorname{Null}(A)=\\{0\\}$, then $\\operatorname{Null}(A)$ has no basis.* ×\n\nEvery finite-dimensional subspace has a basis. The zero subspace has the empty basis.\n\n- The following statement is false:\n\n*If $A$ is a $n\\times n$ matrix and $\\operatorname{Null}(A)=\\{0\\}$, then $\\operatorname{Col}(A)\\subsetneq\\mathbb{R}^{n}$.* ×\n\nThe given condition implies $\\operatorname{rank}(A)=n$ and $\\operatorname{nullity}(A)=0$. Thus $\\operatorname{Col}(A)=\\mathbb{R}^{n}$.\n\n- The following statement is true:\n\n*If $A$ is a $n\\times n$ matrix and $\\operatorname{Null}(A)=\\{0\\}$, then $\\operatorname{nullity}(A)=0$.* ✓\n\nThe given condition implies $\\operatorname{rank}(A)=n$ and $\\operatorname{nullity}(A)=0$. Thus $\\operatorname{nullity}(A)=0$.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is III only."] [:db/add "24f7a599-64fa-59b0-bc94-5119ac1b11b5" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "24f7a599-64fa-59b0-bc94-5119ac1b11b5" :question/answer-fields "e61f64c2-6321-5d18-9115-5e8492b4d1ce"] [:db/ensure "24f7a599-64fa-59b0-bc94-5119ac1b11b5" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186124629 :knowledge-point/questions "24f7a599-64fa-59b0-bc94-5119ac1b11b5"] [:db/add "a8c55ca2-2506-540d-8b37-d903917854aa" :answer/id #uuid "a8c55ca2-2506-540d-8b37-d903917854aa"] [:db/add "a8c55ca2-2506-540d-8b37-d903917854aa" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "a8c55ca2-2506-540d-8b37-d903917854aa" :answer/value "II and III only"] [:db/ensure "a8c55ca2-2506-540d-8b37-d903917854aa" :answer/validate] [:db/add "f803c880-b273-55c6-86f9-5f9ae0631781" :answer/id #uuid "f803c880-b273-55c6-86f9-5f9ae0631781"] [:db/add "f803c880-b273-55c6-86f9-5f9ae0631781" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "f803c880-b273-55c6-86f9-5f9ae0631781" :answer/value "I and III only"] [:db/ensure "f803c880-b273-55c6-86f9-5f9ae0631781" :answer/validate] [:db/add "4238513f-e322-530e-9565-e1ef6525b9d9" :answer/id #uuid "4238513f-e322-530e-9565-e1ef6525b9d9"] [:db/add "4238513f-e322-530e-9565-e1ef6525b9d9" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "4238513f-e322-530e-9565-e1ef6525b9d9" :answer/value "I and II only"] [:db/ensure "4238513f-e322-530e-9565-e1ef6525b9d9" :answer/validate] [:db/add "040ad0ff-3100-5425-b2f1-da7e669a2b4d" :answer/id #uuid "040ad0ff-3100-5425-b2f1-da7e669a2b4d"] [:db/add "040ad0ff-3100-5425-b2f1-da7e669a2b4d" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "040ad0ff-3100-5425-b2f1-da7e669a2b4d" :answer/value "II only"] [:db/ensure "040ad0ff-3100-5425-b2f1-da7e669a2b4d" :answer/validate] [:db/add "756e0384-4d12-5af5-b55c-3d54c0e1e087" :answer/id #uuid "756e0384-4d12-5af5-b55c-3d54c0e1e087"] [:db/add "756e0384-4d12-5af5-b55c-3d54c0e1e087" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "756e0384-4d12-5af5-b55c-3d54c0e1e087" :answer/value "I only"] [:db/ensure "756e0384-4d12-5af5-b55c-3d54c0e1e087" :answer/validate] [:db/add "64adbc10-22f8-5b06-93cc-be533f313081" :answer-field/id #uuid "64adbc10-22f8-5b06-93cc-be533f313081"] [:db/add "64adbc10-22f8-5b06-93cc-be533f313081" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "64adbc10-22f8-5b06-93cc-be533f313081" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "64adbc10-22f8-5b06-93cc-be533f313081" :answer-field/choices "a8c55ca2-2506-540d-8b37-d903917854aa"] [:db/add "64adbc10-22f8-5b06-93cc-be533f313081" :answer-field/choices "f803c880-b273-55c6-86f9-5f9ae0631781"] [:db/add "64adbc10-22f8-5b06-93cc-be533f313081" :answer-field/choices "4238513f-e322-530e-9565-e1ef6525b9d9"] [:db/add "64adbc10-22f8-5b06-93cc-be533f313081" :answer-field/choices "040ad0ff-3100-5425-b2f1-da7e669a2b4d"] [:db/add "64adbc10-22f8-5b06-93cc-be533f313081" :answer-field/choices "756e0384-4d12-5af5-b55c-3d54c0e1e087"] [:db/add "64adbc10-22f8-5b06-93cc-be533f313081" :answer-field/correct "4238513f-e322-530e-9565-e1ef6525b9d9"] [:db/ensure "64adbc10-22f8-5b06-93cc-be533f313081" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "ece9d320-1fda-5bca-bfdf-852dee2b03f3" :question/id #uuid "ece9d320-1fda-5bca-bfdf-852dee2b03f3"] [:db/add "ece9d320-1fda-5bca-bfdf-852dee2b03f3" :question/problem "Consider the following sentence:\n\n*If $A$ is a $n\\times n$ matrix and $\\operatorname{Null}(A)\\ne\\{0\\}$, then $\\underline{\\phantom{xxxxxx}}$.*\n\nWhich of the following can be placed into the blank space to make a true statement?\n\nI. $A$ is **not** invertible\n\nII. $\\det(A)=0$\n\nIII. $\\operatorname{rank}(A)=n$"] [:db/add "ece9d320-1fda-5bca-bfdf-852dee2b03f3" :question/worked-solution "The invertible matrix theorem states the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{gathered}A\\text{ is invertible}\\\\\\Updownarrow\\\\\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{Col}(A)&=\\mathbb{R}^{n}\\\\\\dim(\\operatorname{Col}(A))&=n=\\operatorname{rank}(A)\\\\\\operatorname{Null}(A)&=\\{0\\}\\\\\\dim(\\operatorname{Null}(A))&=0=\\operatorname{nullity}(A)\\end{aligned}\\end{gathered}\n$$\n\nWith that in mind, let's examine each of the options separately.\n\n- The following statement is true:\n\n*If $A$ is a $n\\times n$ matrix and $\\operatorname{Null}(A)\\ne\\{0\\}$, then $A$ is **not** invertible.* ✓\n\nThe given condition implies $\\operatorname{rank}(A)<n$ and $\\operatorname{nullity}(A)>0$. Thus $A$ is **not** invertible.\n\n- The following statement is true:\n\n*If $A$ is a $n\\times n$ matrix and $\\operatorname{Null}(A)\\ne\\{0\\}$, then $\\det(A)=0$.* ✓\n\nThe given condition implies $\\operatorname{rank}(A)<n$ and $\\operatorname{nullity}(A)>0$. Thus $\\det(A)=0$.\n\n- The following statement is false:\n\n*If $A$ is a $n\\times n$ matrix and $\\operatorname{Null}(A)\\ne\\{0\\}$, then $\\operatorname{rank}(A)=n$.* ×\n\nThe given condition implies $\\operatorname{rank}(A)<n$ and $\\operatorname{nullity}(A)>0$. Thus $\\operatorname{rank}(A)<n$.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is I and II only."] [:db/add "ece9d320-1fda-5bca-bfdf-852dee2b03f3" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "ece9d320-1fda-5bca-bfdf-852dee2b03f3" :question/answer-fields "64adbc10-22f8-5b06-93cc-be533f313081"] [:db/ensure "ece9d320-1fda-5bca-bfdf-852dee2b03f3" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186124629 :knowledge-point/questions "ece9d320-1fda-5bca-bfdf-852dee2b03f3"] [:db/add "3b0d39f6-4254-5d22-bf4e-6febe4ad2533" :answer/id #uuid "3b0d39f6-4254-5d22-bf4e-6febe4ad2533"] [:db/add "3b0d39f6-4254-5d22-bf4e-6febe4ad2533" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "3b0d39f6-4254-5d22-bf4e-6febe4ad2533" :answer/value "false"] [:db/ensure "3b0d39f6-4254-5d22-bf4e-6febe4ad2533" :answer/validate] [:db/add "09e0c05b-14aa-5e14-b955-527ebc07ec4c" :answer/id #uuid "09e0c05b-14aa-5e14-b955-527ebc07ec4c"] [:db/add "09e0c05b-14aa-5e14-b955-527ebc07ec4c" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "09e0c05b-14aa-5e14-b955-527ebc07ec4c" :answer/value "true"] [:db/ensure "09e0c05b-14aa-5e14-b955-527ebc07ec4c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "956051b9-5768-5547-88b9-3b7e942076a5" :answer-field/id #uuid "956051b9-5768-5547-88b9-3b7e942076a5"] [:db/add "956051b9-5768-5547-88b9-3b7e942076a5" :answer-field/key "$\\det(A)=0$"] [:db/add "956051b9-5768-5547-88b9-3b7e942076a5" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox] [:db/add "956051b9-5768-5547-88b9-3b7e942076a5" :answer-field/choices "3b0d39f6-4254-5d22-bf4e-6febe4ad2533"] [:db/add "956051b9-5768-5547-88b9-3b7e942076a5" :answer-field/choices "09e0c05b-14aa-5e14-b955-527ebc07ec4c"] [:db/add "956051b9-5768-5547-88b9-3b7e942076a5" :answer-field/correct "3b0d39f6-4254-5d22-bf4e-6febe4ad2533"] [:db/ensure "956051b9-5768-5547-88b9-3b7e942076a5" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "eb5e628e-f4dc-5d13-9581-7e8bb52ecd66" :answer/id #uuid "eb5e628e-f4dc-5d13-9581-7e8bb52ecd66"] [:db/add "eb5e628e-f4dc-5d13-9581-7e8bb52ecd66" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "eb5e628e-f4dc-5d13-9581-7e8bb52ecd66" :answer/value "false"] [:db/ensure "eb5e628e-f4dc-5d13-9581-7e8bb52ecd66" :answer/validate] [:db/add "348adaf6-7787-565e-9ff4-1f701aa97384" :answer/id #uuid "348adaf6-7787-565e-9ff4-1f701aa97384"] [:db/add "348adaf6-7787-565e-9ff4-1f701aa97384" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "348adaf6-7787-565e-9ff4-1f701aa97384" :answer/value "true"] [:db/ensure "348adaf6-7787-565e-9ff4-1f701aa97384" :answer/validate] [:db/add "987163a9-96d8-5ed7-b484-24cd137c96e9" :answer-field/id #uuid "987163a9-96d8-5ed7-b484-24cd137c96e9"] [:db/add "987163a9-96d8-5ed7-b484-24cd137c96e9" :answer-field/key "$\\operatorname{Col}(A)=\\mathbb{R}^{7}$"] [:db/add "987163a9-96d8-5ed7-b484-24cd137c96e9" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox] [:db/add "987163a9-96d8-5ed7-b484-24cd137c96e9" :answer-field/choices "eb5e628e-f4dc-5d13-9581-7e8bb52ecd66"] [:db/add "987163a9-96d8-5ed7-b484-24cd137c96e9" :answer-field/choices "348adaf6-7787-565e-9ff4-1f701aa97384"] [:db/add "987163a9-96d8-5ed7-b484-24cd137c96e9" :answer-field/correct "348adaf6-7787-565e-9ff4-1f701aa97384"] [:db/ensure "987163a9-96d8-5ed7-b484-24cd137c96e9" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "14c0ef31-2044-5855-a7a9-cab2011298ac" :answer/id #uuid "14c0ef31-2044-5855-a7a9-cab2011298ac"] [:db/add "14c0ef31-2044-5855-a7a9-cab2011298ac" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "14c0ef31-2044-5855-a7a9-cab2011298ac" :answer/value "false"] [:db/ensure "14c0ef31-2044-5855-a7a9-cab2011298ac" :answer/validate] [:db/add "a0a583d1-5c19-57bb-b0b1-2de813730ab5" :answer/id #uuid "a0a583d1-5c19-57bb-b0b1-2de813730ab5"] [:db/add "a0a583d1-5c19-57bb-b0b1-2de813730ab5" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "a0a583d1-5c19-57bb-b0b1-2de813730ab5" :answer/value "true"] [:db/ensure "a0a583d1-5c19-57bb-b0b1-2de813730ab5" :answer/validate] [:db/add "b0d31553-b93e-5bf7-a7e6-04e42a08a1de" :answer-field/id #uuid "b0d31553-b93e-5bf7-a7e6-04e42a08a1de"] [:db/add "b0d31553-b93e-5bf7-a7e6-04e42a08a1de" :answer-field/key "$A$ has fewer than $7$ pivot columns"] [:db/add "b0d31553-b93e-5bf7-a7e6-04e42a08a1de" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox] [:db/add "b0d31553-b93e-5bf7-a7e6-04e42a08a1de" :answer-field/choices "14c0ef31-2044-5855-a7a9-cab2011298ac"] [:db/add "b0d31553-b93e-5bf7-a7e6-04e42a08a1de" :answer-field/choices "a0a583d1-5c19-57bb-b0b1-2de813730ab5"] [:db/add "b0d31553-b93e-5bf7-a7e6-04e42a08a1de" :answer-field/correct "14c0ef31-2044-5855-a7a9-cab2011298ac"] [:db/ensure "b0d31553-b93e-5bf7-a7e6-04e42a08a1de" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "635f4b7d-7d59-52ae-8c0d-6343e80d6951" :question/id #uuid "635f4b7d-7d59-52ae-8c0d-6343e80d6951"] [:db/add "635f4b7d-7d59-52ae-8c0d-6343e80d6951" :question/problem "Consider the following sentence:\n\n*If $A$ is a $7\\times 7$ matrix and $\\operatorname{nullity}(A)=0$, then $\\underline{\\phantom{xxxxxx}}$.*\n\nWhich of the following can be placed into the blank space to make a true statement?\n\nSelect all that apply."] [:db/add "635f4b7d-7d59-52ae-8c0d-6343e80d6951" :question/worked-solution "The invertible matrix theorem states the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{gathered}A\\text{ is invertible}\\\\\\Updownarrow\\\\\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{Col}(A)&=\\mathbb{R}^{7}\\\\\\dim(\\operatorname{Col}(A))&=7=\\operatorname{rank}(A)\\\\\\operatorname{Null}(A)&=\\{0\\}\\\\\\dim(\\operatorname{Null}(A))&=0=\\operatorname{nullity}(A)\\end{aligned}\\end{gathered}\n$$\n\nWith that in mind, let's examine each of the options separately.\n\n- The following statement is false:\n\n*If $A$ is a $7\\times 7$ matrix and $\\operatorname{nullity}(A)=0$, then $\\det(A)=0$.* ×\n\nThe given condition implies $\\operatorname{rank}(A)=7$ and $\\operatorname{nullity}(A)=0$. Thus $\\det(A)\\ne 0$.\n\n- The following statement is true:\n\n*If $A$ is a $7\\times 7$ matrix and $\\operatorname{nullity}(A)=0$, then $\\operatorname{Col}(A)=\\mathbb{R}^{7}$.* ✓\n\nThe given condition implies $\\operatorname{rank}(A)=7$ and $\\operatorname{nullity}(A)=0$. Thus $\\operatorname{Col}(A)=\\mathbb{R}^{7}$.\n\n- The following statement is false:\n\n*If $A$ is a $7\\times 7$ matrix and $\\operatorname{nullity}(A)=0$, then $A$ has fewer than $7$ pivot columns.* ×\n\nThe given condition implies $\\operatorname{rank}(A)=7$ and $\\operatorname{nullity}(A)=0$. Thus $A$ has $7$ pivot columns.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is $\\operatorname{Col}(A)=\\mathbb{R}^{7}$."] [:db/add "635f4b7d-7d59-52ae-8c0d-6343e80d6951" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "635f4b7d-7d59-52ae-8c0d-6343e80d6951" :question/answer-fields "956051b9-5768-5547-88b9-3b7e942076a5"] [:db/add "635f4b7d-7d59-52ae-8c0d-6343e80d6951" :question/answer-fields "987163a9-96d8-5ed7-b484-24cd137c96e9"] [:db/add "635f4b7d-7d59-52ae-8c0d-6343e80d6951" :question/answer-fields "b0d31553-b93e-5bf7-a7e6-04e42a08a1de"] [:db/ensure "635f4b7d-7d59-52ae-8c0d-6343e80d6951" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186124629 :knowledge-point/questions "635f4b7d-7d59-52ae-8c0d-6343e80d6951"] [:db/add "987039ff-1afd-51f5-acdd-306be4aaac88" :answer/id #uuid "987039ff-1afd-51f5-acdd-306be4aaac88"] [:db/add "987039ff-1afd-51f5-acdd-306be4aaac88" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "987039ff-1afd-51f5-acdd-306be4aaac88" :answer/value "false"] [:db/ensure "987039ff-1afd-51f5-acdd-306be4aaac88" :answer/validate] [:db/add "1045ca11-00a7-54f5-82df-d90677220306" :answer/id #uuid "1045ca11-00a7-54f5-82df-d90677220306"] [:db/add "1045ca11-00a7-54f5-82df-d90677220306" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "1045ca11-00a7-54f5-82df-d90677220306" :answer/value "true"] [:db/ensure "1045ca11-00a7-54f5-82df-d90677220306" :answer/validate] [:db/add "970549a2-6eb7-57d6-af88-f32a52d1299f" :answer-field/id #uuid "970549a2-6eb7-57d6-af88-f32a52d1299f"] [:db/add "970549a2-6eb7-57d6-af88-f32a52d1299f" :answer-field/key "$A$ is **not** invertible"] [:db/add "970549a2-6eb7-57d6-af88-f32a52d1299f" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox] [:db/add "970549a2-6eb7-57d6-af88-f32a52d1299f" :answer-field/choices "987039ff-1afd-51f5-acdd-306be4aaac88"] [:db/add "970549a2-6eb7-57d6-af88-f32a52d1299f" :answer-field/choices "1045ca11-00a7-54f5-82df-d90677220306"] [:db/add "970549a2-6eb7-57d6-af88-f32a52d1299f" :answer-field/correct "987039ff-1afd-51f5-acdd-306be4aaac88"] [:db/ensure "970549a2-6eb7-57d6-af88-f32a52d1299f" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "5d553a7c-18de-5cec-850b-80701a20b3ca" :answer/id #uuid "5d553a7c-18de-5cec-850b-80701a20b3ca"] [:db/add "5d553a7c-18de-5cec-850b-80701a20b3ca" :answer/type :