answer-field/key "$A$ has $n$ pivot columns"] [:db/add "01abd1c7-c59f-5c99-9277-f9537d6b88ca" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox] [:db/add "01abd1c7-c59f-5c99-9277-f9537d6b88ca" :answer-field/choices "99a5c457-06a2-52cc-aa45-339994a36685"] [:db/add "01abd1c7-c59f-5c99-9277-f9537d6b88ca" :answer-field/choices "81068501-c0e2-5f32-acb0-2aace6ed6c10"] [:db/add "01abd1c7-c59f-5c99-9277-f9537d6b88ca" :answer-field/correct "81068501-c0e2-5f32-acb0-2aace6ed6c10"] [:db/ensure "01abd1c7-c59f-5c99-9277-f9537d6b88ca" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "a51a92b7-4da1-53a7-a184-875247f5a8f5" :question/id #uuid "a51a92b7-4da1-53a7-a184-875247f5a8f5"] [:db/add "a51a92b7-4da1-53a7-a184-875247f5a8f5" :question/problem "Consider the following sentence:\n\n*If $A$ is a $n\\times n$ matrix and $\\operatorname{Col}(A)=\\mathbb{R}^{n}$, then $\\underline{\\phantom{xxxxxx}}$.*\n\nWhich of the following can be placed into the blank space to make a true statement?\n\nSelect all that apply."] [:db/add "a51a92b7-4da1-53a7-a184-875247f5a8f5" :question/worked-solution "The invertible matrix theorem states the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{gathered}A\\text{ is invertible}\\\\\\Updownarrow\\\\\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{Col}(A)&=\\mathbb{R}^{n}\\\\\\dim(\\operatorname{Col}(A))&=n=\\operatorname{rank}(A)\\\\\\operatorname{Null}(A)&=\\{0\\}\\\\\\dim(\\operatorname{Null}(A))&=0=\\operatorname{nullity}(A)\\end{aligned}\\end{gathered}\n$$\n\nWith that in mind, let's examine each of the options separately.\n\n- The following statement is false:\n\n*If $A$ is a $n\\times n$ matrix and $\\operatorname{Col}(A)=\\mathbb{R}^{n}$, then $A$ is **not** invertible.* ×\n\nThe given condition implies $\\operatorname{rank}(A)=n$ and $\\operatorname{nullity}(A)=0$. Thus $A$ is invertible.\n\n- The following statement is false:\n\n*If $A$ is a $n\\times n$ matrix and $\\operatorname{Col}(A)=\\mathbb{R}^{n}$, then $\\operatorname{rank}(A)<n$.* ×\n\nThe given condition implies $\\operatorname{rank}(A)=n$ and $\\operatorname{nullity}(A)=0$. Thus $\\operatorname{rank}(A)=n$.\n\n- The following statement is true:\n\n*If $A$ is a $n\\times n$ matrix and $\\operatorname{Col}(A)=\\mathbb{R}^{n}$, then $A$ has $n$ pivot columns.* ✓\n\nThe given condition implies $\\operatorname{rank}(A)=n$ and $\\operatorname{nullity}(A)=0$. Thus $A$ has $n$ pivot columns.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is $A$ has $n$ pivot columns."] [:db/add "a51a92b7-4da1-53a7-a184-875247f5a8f5" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "a51a92b7-4da1-53a7-a184-875247f5a8f5" :question/answer-fields "970549a2-6eb7-57d6-af88-f32a52d1299f"] [:db/add "a51a92b7-4da1-53a7-a184-875247f5a8f5" :question/answer-fields "752229c8-1a98-538b-b81c-a0f7d16e0605"] [:db/add "a51a92b7-4da1-53a7-a184-875247f5a8f5" :question/answer-fields "01abd1c7-c59f-5c99-9277-f9537d6b88ca"] [:db/ensure "a51a92b7-4da1-53a7-a184-875247f5a8f5" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186124629 :knowledge-point/questions "a51a92b7-4da1-53a7-a184-875247f5a8f5"] [:db/add "7aa16602-e7c9-54cd-a27f-713bd6b96dc4" :answer/id #uuid "7aa16602-e7c9-54cd-a27f-713bd6b96dc4"] [:db/add "7aa16602-e7c9-54cd-a27f-713bd6b96dc4" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "7aa16602-e7c9-54cd-a27f-713bd6b96dc4" :answer/value "II and III only"] [:db/ensure "7aa16602-e7c9-54cd-a27f-713bd6b96dc4" :answer/validate] [:db/add "9b066337-30b7-5051-a050-f4cc7caba6b5" :answer/id #uuid "9b066337-30b7-5051-a050-f4cc7caba6b5"] [:db/add "9b066337-30b7-5051-a050-f4cc7caba6b5" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "9b066337-30b7-5051-a050-f4cc7caba6b5" :answer/value "I only"] [:db/ensure "9b066337-30b7-5051-a050-f4cc7caba6b5" :answer/validate] [:db/add "6cf403e2-fc73-51e8-93ac-21bd4fa4deb1" :answer/id #uuid "6cf403e2-fc73-51e8-93ac-21bd4fa4deb1"] [:db/add "6cf403e2-fc73-51e8-93ac-21bd4fa4deb1" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "6cf403e2-fc73-51e8-93ac-21bd4fa4deb1" :answer/value "II only"] [:db/ensure "6cf403e2-fc73-51e8-93ac-21bd4fa4deb1" :answer/validate] [:db/add "f20ce81b-8827-55b8-8eda-03664eee7b4c" :answer/id #uuid "f20ce81b-8827-55b8-8eda-03664eee7b4c"] [:db/add "f20ce81b-8827-55b8-8eda-03664eee7b4c" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "f20ce81b-8827-55b8-8eda-03664eee7b4c" :answer/value "III only"] [:db/ensure "f20ce81b-8827-55b8-8eda-03664eee7b4c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "735ac19d-aa52-5baf-a48d-1b36bd66de03" :answer/id #uuid "735ac19d-aa52-5baf-a48d-1b36bd66de03"] [:db/add "735ac19d-aa52-5baf-a48d-1b36bd66de03" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "735ac19d-aa52-5baf-a48d-1b36bd66de03" :answer/value "I and II only"] [:db/ensure "735ac19d-aa52-5baf-a48d-1b36bd66de03" :answer/validate] [:db/add "e7a0c1cc-ebfa-5947-959b-5472ae9f3909" :answer-field/id #uuid "e7a0c1cc-ebfa-5947-959b-5472ae9f3909"] [:db/add "e7a0c1cc-ebfa-5947-959b-5472ae9f3909" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "e7a0c1cc-ebfa-5947-959b-5472ae9f3909" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "e7a0c1cc-ebfa-5947-959b-5472ae9f3909" :answer-field/choices "7aa16602-e7c9-54cd-a27f-713bd6b96dc4"] [:db/add "e7a0c1cc-ebfa-5947-959b-5472ae9f3909" :answer-field/choices "9b066337-30b7-5051-a050-f4cc7caba6b5"] [:db/add "e7a0c1cc-ebfa-5947-959b-5472ae9f3909" :answer-field/choices "6cf403e2-fc73-51e8-93ac-21bd4fa4deb1"] [:db/add "e7a0c1cc-ebfa-5947-959b-5472ae9f3909" :answer-field/choices "f20ce81b-8827-55b8-8eda-03664eee7b4c"] [:db/add "e7a0c1cc-ebfa-5947-959b-5472ae9f3909" :answer-field/choices "735ac19d-aa52-5baf-a48d-1b36bd66de03"] [:db/add "e7a0c1cc-ebfa-5947-959b-5472ae9f3909" :answer-field/correct "f20ce81b-8827-55b8-8eda-03664eee7b4c"] [:db/ensure "e7a0c1cc-ebfa-5947-959b-5472ae9f3909" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "f57a7c6f-101e-5b33-aef0-c7309a1bc9ae" :question/id #uuid "f57a7c6f-101e-5b33-aef0-c7309a1bc9ae"] [:db/add "f57a7c6f-101e-5b33-aef0-c7309a1bc9ae" :question/problem "Consider the following sentence:\n\n*If $A$ is a $n\\times n$ matrix and $\\operatorname{Col}(A)=\\mathbb{R}^{n}$, then $\\underline{\\phantom{xxxxxx}}$.*\n\nWhich of the following can be placed into the blank space to make a true statement?\n\nI. $\\operatorname{rank}(A)<n$\n\nII. $\\operatorname{nullity}(A)>0$\n\nIII. $A$ has $n$ pivot columns"] [:db/add "f57a7c6f-101e-5b33-aef0-c7309a1bc9ae" :question/worked-solution "The invertible matrix theorem states the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{gathered}A\\text{ is invertible}\\\\\\Updownarrow\\\\\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{Col}(A)&=\\mathbb{R}^{n}\\\\\\dim(\\operatorname{Col}(A))&=n=\\operatorname{rank}(A)\\\\\\operatorname{Null}(A)&=\\{0\\}\\\\\\dim(\\operatorname{Null}(A))&=0=\\operatorname{nullity}(A)\\end{aligned}\\end{gathered}\n$$\n\nWith that in mind, let's examine each of the options separately.\n\n- The following statement is false:\n\n*If $A$ is a $n\\times n$ matrix and $\\operatorname{Col}(A)=\\mathbb{R}^{n}$, then $\\operatorname{rank}(A)<n$.* ×\n\nThe given condition implies $\\operatorname{rank}(A)=n$ and $\\operatorname{nullity}(A)=0$. Thus $\\operatorname{rank}(A)=n$.\n\n- The following statement is false:\n\n*If $A$ is a $n\\times n$ matrix and $\\operatorname{Col}(A)=\\mathbb{R}^{n}$, then $\\operatorname{nullity}(A)>0$.* ×\n\nThe given condition implies $\\operatorname{rank}(A)=n$ and $\\operatorname{nullity}(A)=0$. Thus $\\operatorname{nullity}(A)=0$.\n\n- The following statement is true:\n\n*If $A$ is a $n\\times n$ matrix and $\\operatorname{Col}(A)=\\mathbb{R}^{n}$, then $A$ has $n$ pivot columns.* ✓\n\nThe given condition implies $\\operatorname{rank}(A)=n$ and $\\operatorname{nullity}(A)=0$. Thus $A$ has $n$ pivot columns.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is III only."] [:db/add "f57a7c6f-101e-5b33-aef0-c7309a1bc9ae" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "f57a7c6f-101e-5b33-aef0-c7309a1bc9ae" :question/answer-fields "e7a0c1cc-ebfa-5947-959b-5472ae9f3909"] [:db/ensure "f57a7c6f-101e-5b33-aef0-c7309a1bc9ae" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186124629 :knowledge-point/questions "f57a7c6f-101e-5b33-aef0-c7309a1bc9ae"] [:d